name: One More Hotfix
tempo: 136
# Melodic trance. The last fix before the next last fix.
# Form in 4-bar phrases: intro 2, theme 6, answer 4,
# layered theme 6, breakdown 4, bridge 4, return 4, outro 2.
# Voices: lead, bass, harmony, answering arpeggio, kick, snare, hat.
